  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">The Ella Shoulder Bag works well for daily plans and evenings out. Crafted of signature chenille and smooth leather, this large bag features an inside zip pocket for convenient organization. The adjustable strap can be worn short or long on the shoulder.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Signature chenille and smooth leather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric lining</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip-top closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside zip pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">14.0&quot; (L) x 12.75&quot; (H) x 2.5&quot; (W)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Adjustable strap with 11.25&quot; drop; 20&quot; drop with extender</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
